      "writtenOn": "2017-08-31T08:21:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right ,-( We definitely want this to do the right thing:\n\nmake BOARD\u003dhammer -j\nthen\nmake BOARD\u003dhammer TOUCHPAD_FW\u003dxyz -j\n\nSo maybe we could do this:\nifneq ($(TOUCHPAD_FW),)\n.PHONY: $(out)/touchpad_fw_hash.h.new\nendif\n\nSo that we only force the hashing if TOUCHPAD_FW is set...\n\nThat\u0027d break:\nmake BOARD\u003dhammer TOUCHPAD_FW\u003dxyz -j\nmake BOARD\u003dhammer -j\n\nbut maybe we don\u0027t care about that use case?!",
      "parentUuid": "f81adedc_ee28033d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 163,
