      "writtenOn": "2017-08-31T08:30:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "inspired from what the kernel build system is doing in the if_changed macro family, rather than PHONY, you might want to record in a dot file in the build directory what was the TOUCHPAD_FW file used before and re-build if it is newer OR the file name has changed.\nThis would definitely more complicated but likely more correct too.",
      "parentUuid": "4a820e79_262dc021",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 163,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 167,
        "endChar": 37
      },
      "revId": "7bf1d91cf192392903bd2b05d5678b5459d32211",
